{
  "total_duration": 646.318,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.96,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果你想给儿童医院送礼物，这当然是一件很温暖的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 4.31,
      "end": 8.99,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是，如果你骑着一头小象走在城市主街上，会发生什么？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 9.34,
      "end": 13.38,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jimmy Gates 的好心没有问题，可是他的方式出了问题。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 13.73,
      "end": 19.05,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jumbo 太大、太重，还不肯走，结果警察也被卷进来了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 19.4,
      "end": 23.999,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天记住一句话："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "kind idea, safe plan"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 24.349,
      "end": 27.189,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看 Jimmy 的好心。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 27.539,
      "end": 34.539,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：去年圣诞节，马戏团老板 Jimmy Gates 想把礼物送到儿童医院。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 34.889,
      "end": 43.313,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文开头说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Last Christmas, the circus owner, Jimmy Gates, decided to take some presents to a children's hospital"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 43.663,
      "end": 49.199,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Circus owner"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是马戏团老板；这个背景属于旧时代生活。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 49.549,
      "end": 56.669,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们会更在意动物福利和公共安全，所以不要把骑小象上街当成可以模仿的办法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 57.018,
      "end": 64.186,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Last Christmas, the circus owner, take some presents, to a children's hospital"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 64.536,
      "end": 68.576,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，好心计划变成了公共道路问题。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 68.926,
      "end": 75.206,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Jimmy 打扮成 Father Christmas，骑着小象 Jumbo 走上城市主街。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 75.556,
      "end": 82.856,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dressed up as Father Christmas and accompanied by a guard of honour, he set off down the main street"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 83.206,
      "end": 90.534,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Father Christmas"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是英式说法，意思相当于 Santa Claus，圣诞老人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 90.884,
      "end": 99.328,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Main street"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是城市里最忙的主路；一头小象走在这里，车辆和行人都会慢下来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 99.677,
      "end": 108.869,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "dressed up as Father Christmas, accompanied by a guard of honour, set off down the main street, riding a baby elephant"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 109.219,
      "end": 112.499,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，警察把交通逻辑说清楚。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 112.849,
      "end": 120.169,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：警察走过来提醒 Jimmy，他本应该走 side street，因为 Jumbo 正在挡交通。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 120.519,
      "end": 125.611,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He should have known that the police would never allow this sort of thing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 125.961,
      "end": 132.057,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A policeman approached Jimmy and told him he ought to have gone along a side street"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 132.407,
      "end": 138.166,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Side street"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是小路、支路，通常没有 main street 那么忙。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 138.516,
      "end": 145.38,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Jumbo was holding up the traffic"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，不是举起交通，而是把交通堵住、耽误了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 145.73,
      "end": 152.778,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "should have known, approached Jimmy, ought to have gone, holding up the traffic"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 153.128,
      "end": 155.708,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，真正的笑点来了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 156.058,
      "end": 163.898,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Jimmy 同意马上离开，可 Jumbo 拒绝移动，十五个警察只好费力把它推走。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 164.248,
      "end": 169.46,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Though Jimmy agreed to go at once, Jumbo refused to move"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 169.809,
      "end": 175.689,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "于是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Fifteen policemen had to push very hard to get him off the main street"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 176.039,
      "end": 184.263,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "警察很辛苦，但他们觉得这件事很好笑："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The police had a difficult time, but they were most amused"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 184.613,
      "end": 189.573,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后那句 arrest Jumbo 是友好的玩笑，不是真的要惩罚小象。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 189.923,
      "end": 198.235,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "refused to move, had to push very hard, must weigh a few tons, let him off this time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 198.585,
      "end": 202.243,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，Jimmy 到底是好人，还是 troublemaker？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 202.593,
      "end": 208.633,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他的 intention 是 kind。他想给 children's hospital 送 presents，这一点很温暖。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 208.983,
      "end": 212.128,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是他骑 Jumbo 走 main street，就不合适了？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 212.477,
      "end": 218.277,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。公共道路属于 everyone。Kind intention 不能取消 traffic rules。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 218.627,
      "end": 223.011,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么 baby elephant 也是问题？它又不是 naughty。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 223.361,
      "end": 232.401,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jumbo 不是坏，也不是危险角色。它只是 very large, very heavy, and not easy to control in a busy street。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 232.751,
      "end": 234.921,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那他应该怎么办？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 235.271,
      "end": 242.191,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他应该提前申请 permission，选 safer route，也就是 side street 或安排好的路线。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 242.541,
      "end": 245.409,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文里的 circus 是不是以前常见？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 245.759,
      "end": 254.839,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是的，old circuses often used animal acts。但今天我们更重视 animal welfare，也会避免这种 city street stunt。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 255.189,
      "end": 258.818,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以我们可以理解旧故事，但不复制旧做法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 259.168,
      "end": 265.528,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. 这就是 modern bridge：kind idea 加 safe plan，加 respect for others。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 265.878,
      "end": 269.493,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那警察说 arrest Jumbo，是不是很严肃？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 269.842,
      "end": 275.642,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。那是 friendly police humour。因为他们累坏了，却也觉得场面 amusing。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 275.992,
      "end": 280.242,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Let him off this time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是这次放过它？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 280.592,
      "end": 286.952,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。这句话把笑点收住：Jumbo has a good record，所以这次就 let him off。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 287.301,
      "end": 293.709,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Last Christmas, the circus owner, Jimmy Gates, decided to take some presents to a children's hospital."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 294.059,
      "end": 303.275,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dressed up as Father Christmas and accompanied by a 'guard of honour' of six pretty girls, he set off down the main street of the city riding a baby elephant called Jumbo."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 303.625,
      "end": 307.609,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He should have known that the police would never allow this sort of thing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 307.959,
      "end": 314.319,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A policeman approached Jimmy and told him he ought to have gone along a side street as Jumbo was holding up the traffic."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 314.669,
      "end": 318.797,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Though Jimmy agreed to go at once, Jumbo refused to move."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 319.147,
      "end": 323.635,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Fifteen policemen had to push very hard to get him off the main street."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 323.985,
      "end": 328.089,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The police had a difficult time, but they were most amused."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 328.438,
      "end": 334.942,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "'Jumbo must weigh a few tons,' said a policeman afterwards, 'so it was fortunate that we didn't have to carry him."
        }
      ]
    },
